# The payload of this repo is unified diffs applied to LF sources extracted
# from a tarball. A checkout with core.autocrlf=true -- the default on Windows,
# and what GitHub's windows-latest runners use -- rewrites the patch files to
# CRLF, and `patch -p1` then fails to match a single line. Pin them.
*.patch     -text
*.diff      -text
*.tar.gz    binary

# Built by bash on every platform, including msys2.
*.sh        text eol=lf

*.md        text
*.py        text
